---
import RoleTicker from './RoleTicker.astro';
---

<section class="industry">
  <div class="industry__bg" style="background-image: url('/images/industry-professionals-bg.jpg');"></div>
  <div class="industry__overlay"></div>

  <div class="industry__content container section">
    <div class="industry__intro-block" data-reveal>
      <h2>Industry Expertise</h2>
      <p class="industry__intro">
        We understand the challenges faced by network operators and the expertise required to
        drive operational success. That's why CHIME was developed with insights from professionals
        across the industry, ensuring it meets the real-world needs of those working on the front
        lines.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="industry__professionals" data-reveal>
      <h3>Industry Professionals</h3>
      <p>
        At the heart of every successful network operation are the dedicated professionals who
        bring expertise, precision, and innovation to their roles. From design and construction to
        maintenance and oversight, these specialists ensure the seamless function and evolution of
        critical infrastructure.
      </p>
      <p>
        CHIME is built on the collective experience of these industry experts, offering solutions
        to those shaping the future of network operations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <RoleTicker />

    <div class="industry__clear-horizon" data-reveal>
      <img src="/logo/clear-horizon-horizontal.svg" alt="Clear Horizon" width="180" height="36" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <p>
        Our team specialises in the business of regulated network operators. We have consultants
        with over 20 years industry experience combined with highly skilled business analysts,
        solution design and secure enterprise IT service architecture. Our reputation at the most
        senior levels in the industry is built on the strength of our exceptional team.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .industry {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--color-white);
    background: var(--color-ink);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .industry__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .industry__overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.75);
  }

  .industry__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .industry h2 {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .industry__intro {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 48rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .industry__professionals {
    margin-top: var(--space-gutter);
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .industry__professionals h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-blue-pale);
  }

  .industry__professionals p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .industry__professionals p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .industry__clear-horizon {
    margin-top: var(--space-gutter);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .industry__clear-horizon p {
    max-width: 48rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
</style>
